This starts and stops capture; it **does not automatically play, save, or transmit the audio**. For sample processing, `UAudioCapture` inherits the generator-delegate mechanism from `UAudioGenerator`. Alternatively, the lower-level **`Audio::FAudioCapture`** API in `AudioCaptureCore.h` exposes capture-stream callbacks. Those callbacks must not be assumed to run on the game thread.

