The patch below handles straight double quotes (`"..."`) and curly double quotes (`“...”`, which `smartypants` can produce), including quoted text containing Markdown emphasis or links. It leaves code blocks alone. Should single-quoted phrases also count? Those need separate handling to avoid treating apostrophes as quotation marks.

