**Behavior and constraints:**

- Short text has no button.
- Overflowing text displays as `Truncated text… See more` on one row.
- Tapping the button displays all text and removes the button.
- Text, available-width, font-scale, or typography changes reset the component.
- The parent must provide a bounded width wide enough for the button. In a horizontal parent layout, use `containerStyle={{ flex: 1 }}`.
