The following example targets **iOS 17+**. Its bars show recent loudness samples—not frequency bands. That is sufficient for a recording indicator; a true spectrum analyzer would require audio-buffer processing and an FFT.

### 1. Microphone permission

Add this to your target’s Info settings or `Info.plist`:

