Both assistants provide Shadow DOM components with the requested slots, header styling, always-visible intro, and expandable details. Both keep the lower button visible when expanded and relabel it “collapse.” That is a reasonable interpretation: the prompt specifies its collapsed-state behavior but does not require hiding it when expanded.

